 do they prioritize when it comes to  spending what matters most to them I  think they're really actively trying to  pay down that debt it's something that  really helped her their heads and really  stresses them out I think that we also  see them prioritizing experiences food  they like to travel and not just  arthur's vineyard over the season they  like to quit their jobs and travel which  is amazing so a lot of them are saving  money so they can do that how companies  capitalizing on this well I think this  is fascinating because when I  to all the CEOs at financial service  companies at banks this is their  absolute passion how are we getting this  huge generation to become part of our  organization and what we know is they've  got to have a value system because  Millennials do say that part of the  reason they choose to do business with  certain companies is based on the values  of that company and so it's not only  providing a service it's not just about  price its who are you do you stand for  something that I care about and this is  transforming almost every area not just  travel not just restaurants but also  financial service you talk about  technology there's also a lot of  transparency I feel like Lindsey I mean  they're younger a younger generation  will share with one another how much  they make I think they're really open  we're seeing that especially with many  Diaries I'm in front of 29 you know they  really want to share because we grew up  not talking about money right are we're  in polite it was impolite it was not  ladylike yes but then if you're not  talking about it how are you supposed to  know what salary to ask for or how to  invest in your horse or dividend men and  women right different you know there's a  big difference between men and women I  think that there's still a lot of  stigmas around women making a lot of  money making more than their partners  and I think that financial institutions  really talk to women differently and not  always in the best way I think that we  are really the reason money diodes is so  popular is because it's peer-to-peer and  you know it takes away a lot of the  stigmas around money it makes it less  taboo I just don't understand why  Millennials don't want venmo share with  how much with every Connors they pay  everyone else you got Bush the private  side Jill Schlesinger and Lindsey  Stanbury thank you so much

